 "hast": "\n<p>Here are a few things you can do to get started building with shadcn/ui.</p>\n<h2 id=\"add-components\">Add Components</h2>\n<p>Use the CLI to add components to your project.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest add button\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest add button\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest add button\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add button\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest add button\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> button</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Then import and use it in your code.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">app/page.tsx</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"import { Button } from &#x22;@/components/ui/button&#x22;\n\nexport default function Home() {\n  return <Button>Click me</Button>\n}\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> { Button } </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> \"@/components/ui/button\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\"> default</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\"> function</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#8250DF\"> Home</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#953800\">() </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">  return</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Button</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">Click me</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Button</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Unlike traditional component libraries, shadcn/ui adds the component source code directly to your project under <code>components/ui/</code>. You own the code and can customize it however you want.</p>\n<p>You can add multiple components at once or add all available components.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest add button card input label\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest add button card input label\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest add button card input label\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add button card input label\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest add button card input label\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> button</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> card</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> input</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> label</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest add --all\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest add --all\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest add --all\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add --all\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest add --all\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --all</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Browse all components on the <a href=\"/docs/components\">Components</a> page.</p>\n<h2 id=\"customize-your-theme\">Customize Your Theme</h2>\n<p>You can edit your theme directly in your CSS file. Learn more about <a href=\"/docs/theming\">Theming</a> and how to use CSS variables or utility classes.</p>\n<p>If you want to try a new preset, you can create a custom theme visually on <a href=\"https://ui.shadcn.com\">ui.shadcn.com</a> and apply it to your project using a preset code.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest init --preset [CODE]\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest init --preset [CODE]\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest init --preset [CODE]\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest init --preset [CODE]\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest init --preset [CODE]\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> init</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --preset</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> [CODE]</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"add-a-block\">Add a block</h2>\n<p>You can add a block to your project using the CLI.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest add login-03\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest add login-03\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest add login-03\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add login-03\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest add login-03\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> login-03</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>This will add the <code>login-03</code> block to your project. Import and use it in your code.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">app/page.tsx</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"import { Login03 } from &#x22;@/components/login-03&#x22;\n\nexport default function Home() {\n  return <Login03 />\n}\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> { Login03 } </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> \"@/components/login-03\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\"> default</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\"> function</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#8250DF\"> Home</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#953800\">() </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">  return</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Login03</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> /></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"install-from-registries\">Install from Registries</h2>\n<p>shadcn/ui has a growing ecosystem of community registries. You can install components from any registry URL using the CLI.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest add @[registry]/[name]\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest add @[registry]/[name]\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest add @[registry]/[name]\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add @[registry]/[name]\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest add @[registry]/[name]\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> @[registry]/[name]</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Browse the <a href=\"/docs/directory\">Registry Directory</a> for a list of available registries.</p>\n<h2 id=\"use-ai-to-build\">Use AI to Build</h2>\n<p>shadcn/ui is designed to work with AI. Your AI assistant can read the component source code in your project, understand the APIs, and compose them together to build pages and features.</p>\n<p>Here are some example prompts to try:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>\"Create a signup page with a form for entering name, email and password.\"</em></li>\n<li><em>\"Create a settings page with a form for updating profile information.\"</em></li>\n<li><em>\"Build a dashboard with a header, stats cards, and a data table.\"</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"install-the-shadcn-skills\">Install the shadcn Skills</h2>\n<p>Install the shadcn skill in your AI assistant. This will give your AI assistant access to the full component registry, documentation, and search.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx skills add shadcn/ui\" __npm__=\"npx skills add shadcn/ui\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx skills add shadcn/ui\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx skills add shadcn/ui\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun skills add shadcn/ui\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> skills</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn/ui</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Learn more about <a href=\"/docs/skills\">skills</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"connect-the-mcp-server\">Connect the MCP Server</h2>\n<p>The shadcn MCP server gives your AI assistant access to the full component registry, documentation, and search. Connect it in your editor for the best experience.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest mcp init\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest mcp init\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest mcp init\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest mcp init\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest mcp init\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> mcp</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> init</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Learn more on the <a href=\"/docs/mcp\">MCP Server</a> page.</p>"
}
